    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Narrator runs entirely on your device.\n\n• No network access for any core feature (import, parse, narrate, persist).\n• No analytics or tracking SDKs.\n• Your books, bookmarks, and progress never leave the device.\n• The only Android permissions used are the file picker for import and a foreground service for background playback.\n\nThe app may launch external apps (such as the sherpa-onnx TTS engine settings) when you tap their dedicated buttons, but it never sends data to the network on its own.</string>
